Electron adaptation notes (44-x-y):
On this branch Electron's refactor_expose_file_system_access_blocklist.patch
moves GenerateBlockPaths() and its kBlockPaths table out of
chrome_file_system_access_permission_context.cc into the header, so the
upstream hunks against the .cc do not apply. The same blocklist entries were
added, verbatim, to the kBlockPaths table in
chrome_file_system_access_permission_context.h instead. M152 still keeps the
".git/hooks" rule inside the IS_WIN block; the new ".git/config" and
".git/modules" rules are placed right after that block so they apply on every
platform, as they do in the upstream table. The unittest hunks merged as-is.

